OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry with clear periods and a
OL,7,Ffew frost fog patches. Then staying
OL,8,Fdry for the rest of the night although
OL,9,Fturning rather cloudy and breezy by
OL,10,Fdawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FAfter a dry start thickening
OL,13,Fcloud will bring some rain from the
OL,14,Fsouthwest by late morning. Fresh to
OL,15,Fstrong southerly winds, easing in the
OL,16,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
